  instructionText: 'A newly appeared food sits on the left side of the scale. Your
    job is to guess its weight in grams.

    Hover over a food on the shelf to select
    it.

    Press ''E'' to place it on the right pan, or ''F'' to place it on the
    left.

    Press ''E'' or ''F'' again on a placed item to take it back off.

    When
    you''re confident, type your guess and hit Submit Guess. The closer you are,
    the more stars you earn! Good luck and thanks for playing!'
